---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { base } from '../lib/posts';
---
<Base title="About Sahaj Saliya & This Notebook">
  <section class="hero" style="padding-top:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.5rem;">
    <div class="hero-pill">
      <span>👤</span> About the Author
    </div>
    <h1 class="hero-title" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);">
      Sahaj Saliya
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-desc">
      B.Tech ICT Student at Pandit Deendayal Energy University (PDEU), Gandhinagar (2023–2027). Focusing on LLMs, Generative AI, Computer Vision, and Autonomous Multi-Agent Systems.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="https://info.sahaj.si" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">
        Portfolio Website ↗
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/SahajIVVIX-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outline">
        GitHub Profile ↗
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sahajs59" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outline">
        LinkedIn ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="prose" style="margin-top:2rem;">
    <h2>About This Engineering Notebook</h2>
    <p>
      This site is my public engineering journal, starting on <strong>4 August 2023</strong> (my first day at PDEU) and updated continuously. It serves as both a structured learning handbook and an archival log across three primary tracks:
    </p>

    <div style="display:grid;gap:12px;margin:1.5rem 0;">
      <div style="background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.2rem;">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 0.4rem;font-size:1.15rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;">
          <span class="badge badge-study">Study Guides</span> Structured Technical Notes
        </h3>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--muted);">
          Sequential, topic-by-topic curriculum notes across 15 engineering phases. Every code snippet is executed in a controlled Python/C++ environment prior to publishing, ensuring zero broken snippets and real outputs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.2rem;">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 0.4rem;font-size:1.15rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;">
          <span class="badge badge-papers">Paper Digests</span> Frontier Research Breakdowns
        </h3>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--muted);">
          Rigorous breakdowns of breakthrough papers from arXiv and Hugging Face Daily Papers, cataloging mathematical formulations, benchmarks, architectural diagrams, and verified limitations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.2rem;">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 0.4rem;font-size:1.15rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;">
          <span class="badge badge-ai">AI Updates</span> Industry Releases
        </h3>
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--muted);">
          Concise, factual summaries of foundation model releases, technical reports, and major library milestones directly from official engineering blogs and model cards.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Integrity & Attribution Policy</h2>
    <p>
      Every single post cites its primary sources. Benchmarks, parameter counts, and dates are quoted strictly from verified public announcements or papers. All figures are either custom-rendered or reused under explicit Creative Commons (CC-BY) licensing with attribution.
    </p>
    <p>
      Have a correction or question? Open an issue on <a href="https://github.com/SahajIVVIX-1/blogs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
